ceives NOTIFICATION_DRAW.`\n\n\n\nAnd the IK effect of both bones will be disturbed.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1、Create an empty project\n2、Create a new scene and save it. The type is Skeleton2D\n3、Create two bones and add IK\n4、Add SkeletonModificationStack2D and SkeletonModification2DTwoBoneIK\n5、Check resource_local_to_scene\n6、Drag and drop the scene to a new scene\n7、Engine crash\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18549693/bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102054/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102054/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}